    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "British type designer based in Tallinn, Estonia; commercial and custom typefaces across Latin, Greek and Cyrillic, trading as East of Rome (also logos, editorial and sign painting). Reading MATD graduate (2018/19); roughly 6-7 years of independent practice. Awards: Granshan Grand Prize 2019 (Columba), Morisawa 2019 finalist, silver at 2017 ADC Estonian Design Awards (Imperija). Commercial typefaces include Columba, Livo Display, Imperija, Waba, Andra, Oselian; sells via Future Fonts. Behance @LewisMcGuffie. Work Status: Freelance, evidenced by site (self-described independent foundry) and IG bio ('Fringe Typographer, Latin, Greek & Cyrillic'). LinkedIn not documented by scraper; may exist. Seniority: mid-to-senior independent; authors whole typeface families, runs his own micro-foundry, multiple award wins by year 1 of practice. Autonomy 4: sole author of all families, fully self-directed.",
